From f91a42f170ee479ecf35e69ea3f9050bd823b889 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:43:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Build from local packages: no remote resolution, libpng from
 prose-packages

The build resolved third-party packages from eu.hpkg.haiku-os.org: the
package list in build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/<arch> is checksummed
and that checksum selects a server-side repository snapshot, so a locally
built package could not be added at all (adding one made the build fetch
a snapshot that does not exist - 404).

Haiku already supports building without that: with HAIKU_NO_DOWNLOADS=1
the build synthesises the repository from whatever .hpkg files are in
generated/download/ and only offers packages whose files are actually
present. Set it in generated/build/BuildConfig (not tracked - see
private_workspace/README.md) and drop packages into generated/download/.

With that, libpng16 and libpng16_devel (built in prose-packages) are
listed in the repository and PNGTranslator builds and ships. libpng16 is
added to the image through UserBuildConfig so the translator has its
runtime library.

Note: locally built packages must carry the vendor the repository expects
("Haiku Project"); package_repo rejects a foreign vendor outright. The
prose-packages builds say "Prose", so their .PackageInfo is rewritten and
the package recreated before use.

Result: the PROSE wallpaper renders on the desktop.

Testing note: verify the desktop in a windowed run. A headless
--screenshot dumps the surface pool, and with no window, no display link
and no input the desktop never repaints the background into the front
buffer, so it shows the pre-wallpaper state and looks like a failure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/UserBuildConfig               | 5 +++++
 build/jam/images/definitions/minimum    | 1 +
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 8 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 build/jam/UserBuildConfig

diff --git a/build/jam/UserBuildConfig b/build/jam/UserBuildConfig
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..b41a619728
--- /dev/null
+++ b/build/jam/UserBuildConfig
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# PROSE fork: packages this image needs beyond the profile's own list.
+# libpng16 provides the runtime library for PNGTranslator, which Tracker needs
+# to decode the desktop wallpaper. The package is built in prose-packages and
+# resolved locally (HAIKU_NO_DOWNLOADS=1, see private_workspace/README.md).
+AddHaikuImageSystemPackages libpng16 ;
diff --git a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
index d15c95d3ec..0ff4abcdc5 100644
--- a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
+++ b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
@@ -282,6 +282,7 @@ SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_ACCELERANTS = [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
 ] ;
 
 SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS =
+	PNGTranslator@libpng
 	STXTTranslator
 ;
 
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index 85ff062d54..ffd377c1f9 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -39,6 +39,8 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	python3.10-3.10.19_bootstrap-1
 	sed-4.9_bootstrap-1
 	texinfo-7.2_bootstrap-1
+	libpng16-1.6.53-1
+	libpng16_devel-1.6.53-1
 	zlib-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
 	zlib_devel-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
 	:
